IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `hsa-charges`

-- Health Services Act 2016 (WA), ss 7, 8, 34(2)(f), 53A, 53B, 55, 57, 57A, 57C, 57D, 217, 219, 220, with the Health Services
-- (Fees and Charges) Order 2016 (version from 1 July 2026) cll 3, 3A, 5, 6, 6A, 7, 8, 10A, 11-15 and Schedule 1 Divisions 1-4 --
-- worked cases from the seat of the public patient.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked against a
-- decided case, the National Health Reform Agreement or WA Health billing practice.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_health-services-act-2016_baseline.py).
-- Expected results were written by hand from the text.
--
-- Facts are from the Western Australian cradle-to-grave lives (workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-*) where they exist;
-- the event id is in the fixture's name. "compared" fixtures change one fact of a life (the public/private election) to show
-- the difference. Other persons are invented for the case. Every dollar figure is the Order's figure in force from 1 July
-- 2026; the lives' 2030 and 2063 events are answered under it. MBS amounts are HYPOTHETICAL.

