§ `Order cll 7, 8; Schedule 1 Divisions 3, 4 -- MRI and pathology`

-- One region with gadolinium: $1,735 + $205 = $1,940. A Medicare-eligible public out-patient: Division 3 fixes nothing.
#ASSERT `What does the hospital charge me for an MRI study` `a visitor who is not Medicare-eligible` `as an out-patient` TRUE `one region of the body` TRUE EQUALS (`a fixed charge of` 1940)
#ASSERT `What does the hospital charge me for an MRI study` `a patient with a damages claim` `as an in-patient` TRUE `2 or more separate regions` FALSE EQUALS (`a fixed charge of` 3465)
#ASSERT `What does the hospital charge me for an MRI study` `Chloe at 26, a Medicare-eligible public patient (c060)` `as an out-patient` TRUE `one region of the body` FALSE EQUALS `not fixed by the Order`

-- Hypothetical MBS amount of $100. Electing private pathology as an out-patient: 85% = $85.
#ASSERT `What does the hospital charge me for a pathology service` `Chloe at 26, a Medicare-eligible public patient (c060)` `as an out-patient` TRUE 100 EQUALS (`a fixed charge of` 85)
#ASSERT `What does the hospital charge me for a pathology service` `Chloe at 26, electing to be a private patient (c060 compared)` `as an in-patient` FALSE 100 EQUALS (`a fixed charge of` 100)
#ASSERT `What does the hospital charge me for a pathology service` `Chloe at 26, a Medicare-eligible public patient (c060)` `as an out-patient` FALSE 100 EQUALS `not fixed by the Order`

